description	"Jedi Revanchist Crusader

A war adapted Jedi, has no issue using blasters stolen or equipped from enemies or ally alike, has heavy armor under their robes.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Lightsaber (Yellow/Cyan Style)
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- Blaster Defense/Deflect (1)
-- Saberthrow (2)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Assemble (1) 
- Force Focus (2)
- Beskar (1)

^8Powers:
- Jump (2)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS2]"